# Bustamam Technology Website

## Purpose

This website is the official website for **Bustamam Technology**, a consulting practice that helps startups start up.

## Core Mission

**"We help startups start up"**

## Website Goals

- Showcase Bustamam Technology's consulting services
- Attract startup founders and entrepreneurs as potential clients
- Communicate the value proposition: technical partner for startups from idea to launch and beyond
- Provide a professional, modern, and trustworthy online presence

## Target Audience

- Startup founders
- Entrepreneurs with technical needs
- Early-stage companies needing technical expertise
- Startups looking for MVP development or scaling support

## Technical Stack

- TanStack Start (React framework)
- shadcn/ui components
- Tailwind CSS
- TypeScript
